  "idea": "Zapier transfer tool for bulk migrating legacy spreadsheet data",
  "text": "This is the fastest way to move five thousand messy rows from Excel into Airtable. Operations managers waste entire days reformatting date columns and pasting client records between mismatched spreadsheets. Manual entry creates duplicate rows, corrupts relational links, and loses critical customer deal history. Instead, use Zapier Transfer to map Excel fields into your Airtable schema and migrate historical records in bulk. Your database goes live without data loss.",
